msgid ""
"Next, define a function that collects shadow snapshots by rotating the GHZ "
"state into random Pauli bases. This mirrors what the Sampler primitive does "
"on hardware in the large-scale example.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-"
