#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Assess shot scaling {#assess-shot-scaling}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, 5,000 snapshots are used to estimate the observables. The "
"shot scaling of shadow tomography is assessed by plotting the mean error of "
"one of the estimated functions against different shot budgets. The error in "
"the two-qubit correlator decays as $1/\\sqrt{T}$ as expected for the "
"standard statistical convergence of a mean estimator. The importance of "
"shadow tomography is that the constant prefactor in front of $1/\\sqrt{T}$ "
"does not grow with the number of qubits for local observables, such as those"
" examined in this tutorial.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
